          <description>If this Detachment is your Primary detachment, you can re-roll the result when rolling on the Emperor&apos;s Children Warlord Traits table.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Combat Drugs" id="3179-efa9-6f0b-dd75" hidden="false">
          <description>After Deployment, roll a dice and consult the following table to see what effects the combat drugs have on the characteristic profiles of all non-vehicle units from this Detachment for the duration of the game.

D6 Result
1  +1 WS
2  +1 BS
3  +1 I
4  +1 S
5  +1 T
6  +1 A</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
