          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Lord of the Long War" id="cd76-281b-24cd-822a" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="25"/>
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Lord of the Long War" id="de26-8330-0c5b-ab47" hidden="false">
                  <description>Can accept and issue challenges as though it&apos;s a Character.
When the Ferrum Infernus suffers an Explode result (not wrecked), roll a D6

1-2: The Ferrum Infernus becomes a spawn
3-4: Re-roll the Vehicle Damage result
5-6: Becomes a Daemon Prince (Dark Apotheosis)</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Hosts of Daemonic Iron" id="410f-23ac-8874-6de6" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="20"/>
              </costs>
              <infoLinks>
                <infoLink name="Daemonic Resilience" id="b429-d61a-6d99-74c7" hidden="false" targetId="7c7b47f7-5150-42a0-96f3-1b7219635aac" type="rule"/>
              </infoLinks>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Hosts of Daemonic Iron" id="f307-9156-99e9-8b53" hidden="false">
                  <description>Gains Daemonic Resilience. Any unit that takes a HP off the Ferrum Infernus suffers a Str 4 AP 3 hit per HP lost.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Destroyer of Cities" id="06c6-67d3-f7a9-4db0" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="30"/>
              </costs>
              <infoLinks>
                <infoLink name="Move Through Cover" id="322b-814f-559c-59ca" hidden="false" targetId="7ecc-bc3d-6e22-63dc" type="rule"/>
              </infoLinks>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Destroyer of Cities" id="d192-1266-9f47-d535" hidden="false">
                  <description>Takes Assault Drill instead of DCCW. The Dreadnoughts armour is increased by +1 and it gains Move Through Cover.
If the Dreadnought inflicts a Penetrating hit with the Assault drill against building or vehicles (and is not destroyed), then all models inside suffer a single hit from the Heavy Flamer built into the Assault Drill. Flamer attack is once per assault phase, not per hit. These attacks are resolved after the Dreadnoughts other attacks.

In Cities of Death, Engines count as havin the Wrecker Strategem for free.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry name="Flamestorm Cannon" id="49c3-eaed-6014-dc42" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="minSelections" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="false" type="min" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="maxSelections" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="false" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
