          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Unbridled Wrath" id="7f76-dc93-e607-2dab" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of your Shooting phase, the Dark Apostle from the Brethren of the Dark Covenant can scream a litany of rage and bloodshed instead of shooting. If he does so, each other unit from the Formation that is wihin 12&quot; is filled with unholy zeal, and gains the Zealot and Feel No Pain special rules until the start of your next turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
