          <description>At the start of each of your Psychic phases, select one model from the Cyclopia Cabal to lead it in a dark ritual. That model can attemp to manifest the Shroud of Deceit psychic power. For each other Sorcerer from this formation that is within 12&quot;, add one dice to the Psychic Test - these dice do not cost any Warp Charge points.</description>
