      <rules>
        <rule name="The Hamadrya" id="4ae8-6bfe-2503-4c01" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>The Hamadrya is a Combat Familiar and makes Huron a Psyker (Mastery Level 1).
At the beginning of each turn, roll a D3 (consulting the table in Hurons profile in Codex: CSM) and then generate a power from the discipline rolled. The generated power may only be used for that turn only.</description>
