          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Vehicles with transport capacity only. Should the vehicle suffer a Crew Stunned or shaken result, on a 4+ of a D6 roll, it is ignored (though the Hull points are still lost).   Gains preferred Enemy (Tyranids) and the transported unit gains Hatred (Tyranids)</characteristic>
