          <description>If this unit contains three Chaos Vindicators that can all fire their demolisher cannons, the squadron can fire a single Linebreaker Bombardment instead of firing normally. To do so, nominate one model in the squadron as the firer; the firer&apos;s demolisher cannon changes its type from Large Blast to Apocalyptic Blast and gains the Ignores Cover special rule.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Vindicators" id="b4d0-1972-f3a7-6e97" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="f663-cf63-f32b-dc96" hidden="false" import="true">
