        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Enervating Pestilential Aura" id="1313-5872-ba54-f51d" hidden="false">
          <description>Enemy models within 7&quot; of any Plague Colony units at the start of the Fight sub-phase must reduce their I and WS by 1 for the duration of the phase. If this Formation includes the maximum number of units at the start of the battle, then enemy models within 7&quot; of any Plague Colony unit at the start of the Fight sub-phase must also reduce their T by 1 for the duration of the phase.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
