        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Whirlwind of Blood" id="2f60-fc6d-fd81-8baa" hidden="false">
          <description>When using Bloodfeeder in close combat, the bearer&apos;s Attacks characteristic is not used; instead, the bearer makes 2D6 Attacks (roll before making Attacks with the bearer each time they use it), which can be increased as normal if the bearer charged, etc. However, for each roll of 1, the bearer immediately suffers a Wound with no armour saves allowed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
